<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1378762448"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1472727607"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="These Are The Times"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Martin Garrix / JRM"/><amll:meta key="album" value="These Are The Times"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:02.634"><div begin="00:47.424" end="03:02.634"><p begin="00:47.424" end="00:49.535" itunes:key="L29976">When life gets you down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你黯然沉浸于生活的失意之中</span></p><p begin="00:49.545" end="00:53.509" itunes:key="L29977">We find a way to make it better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要相信我们终能走出这狼狈困境</span></p><p begin="00:54.479" end="00:57.113" itunes:key="L29978">When days turn into dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当无边的黑暗取代光明的白昼</span></p><p begin="00:57.223" end="01:01.276" itunes:key="L29979">That's when we light it up together<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一刻我们将一起点燃希望的火种</span></p><p begin="01:02.495" end="01:06.192" itunes:key="L29980">These are the times that we've been praying for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我们始终虔诚期待的时刻</span></p><p begin="01:06.202" end="01:10.001" itunes:key="L29981">These are the moments that we will not forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是烙印我们心底的难忘回忆</span></p><p begin="01:10.011" end="01:13.611" itunes:key="L29982">This is the life that we've been waiting for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是我们心之所向的生活</span></p><p begin="01:13.621" end="01:16.754" itunes:key="L29983">I wouldn't change it for nothing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会做任何改变</span></p><p begin="01:17.614" end="01:21.336" itunes:key="L29984">These are the times that we've been praying for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我们始终虔诚期待的时刻</span></p><p begin="01:21.346" end="01:25.158" itunes:key="L29985">These are the moments that we will not forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是烙印我们心底的难忘回忆</span></p><p begin="01:25.168" end="01:28.858" itunes:key="L29986">This is the life that we've been waiting for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是我们心之所向的生活</span></p><p begin="01:28.868" end="01:31.896" itunes:key="L29987">I wouldn't change it for nothing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会做任何改变</span></p><p begin="01:47.854" end="01:50.112" itunes:key="L29988">Now that it's clear<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我心明鉴</span></p><p begin="01:50.122" end="01:53.996" itunes:key="L29989">We made it through the rain together<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们定能挥别风雨迎接彩虹</span></p><p begin="01:54.947" end="01:57.540" itunes:key="L29990">It feels like home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我的家 何不我们永远相守呢？</span></p><p begin="01:57.550" end="02:03.237" itunes:key="L29991">So why don't we just stay forever?</p><p begin="02:18.087" end="02:21.806" itunes:key="L29992">These are the times that we've been praying for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我们始终虔诚期待的时刻</span></p><p begin="02:21.816" end="02:25.634" itunes:key="L29993">These are the moments that we will not forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是烙印我们心底的难忘回忆</span></p><p begin="02:25.644" end="02:29.398" itunes:key="L29994">This is the life that we've been waiting for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是我们心之所向的生活</span></p><p begin="02:29.408" end="02:32.367" itunes:key="L29995">I wouldn't change it for nothing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会做任何改变</span></p><p begin="02:48.225" end="02:51.921" itunes:key="L29996">These are the times that we've been praying for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我们始终虔诚期待的时刻</span></p><p begin="02:51.931" end="02:55.801" itunes:key="L29997">These are the moments that we will not forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是烙印我们心底的难忘回忆</span></p><p begin="02:55.811" end="02:59.661" itunes:key="L29998">This is the life that we've been waiting for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是我们心之所向的生活</span></p><p begin="02:59.671" end="03:02.634" itunes:key="L29999">I wouldn't change it for nothing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会做任何改变</span></p></div></body></tt>